# mygit-lite

A lightweight Git-like version control system implemented in Node.js.

## Installation

```bash
npm install -g mygit-lite
```

## Usage

```bash
mygit init
mygit add <file>
mygit commit -m "message"
mygit log
mygit status
mygit checkout <commit-id>
```

## Features

- Local `.mygit` storage (no DB required)
- SHA-1 content addressing
- Staging area (Index)
- Branching and History

## Development

1. `npm install`
2. `npm test`
